OL,3,ANepo baby is a horrific term, says
OL,4,AZeta-Jones
OL,5,
OL,6,FHollywood star Catherine Zeta-Jones has
OL,7,Fdeclared the phrase "nepo baby" is
OL,8,F"horrific".
OL,10,FThe Mumbles-born actor told The Sunday
OL,11,FTimes: "These kids didn't ask to be
OL,12,Fborn into this."
OL,14,FThe term nepo baby refers to children
OL,15,Fof famous parents perceived to have
OL,16,Fachieved riches and success off their
OL,17,Fparents' backs.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
