OL,3,ANepo baby is a horrific term, says
OL,4,AZeta-Jones
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 56-year-old is married to Kirk
OL,7,FDouglas' son, Michael Douglas, and they
OL,8,Fhave two children - Dylan and Carys -
OL,9,Fwho have both followed their parents
OL,10,Finto showbiz.
